==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|32px]] '''Silk CubicCurve 4''' command creates a parametric Bezier cubic curve, a CubicCurve_4 object, from a ControlPoly4 or ControlPoly4_segment object.

</translate>
