==Usage==

# There are several options for a preselection:
#* Select one [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|ControlPoly4]] in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]] or in the [[3D_View|3D View]].
#* Select one [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4_segment.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4_segment|ControlPoly4_segment]] in the Tree View or in the 3D View.
# There are several ways to invoke the tool.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|16px]] CubicCurve_4}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → CubicCurve_4}} option from the menu.
# A '''CubicCurve_4''' object is created.
# Optionally adjust parameters in the [[Property_View|Property View]].

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''CubicCurve_4''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|C1 - Inputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Poly|Link}}: Control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|reverse|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Reverses the parameter direction.

{{Properties_Title|C3 - Identifiers}}

* {{PropertyData|internalName|String}}: The permanent internal FreeCAD name for this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_type|String}}: Default is {{value|CubicCurve_4}}. The workbench class used to create this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_version|String}}: The class version of this object.


